        "group": "探索の範囲",
        "name": {
          "ja": "完全",
          "en": "complete"
        },
        "definition": {
          "ja": "宣言した scope と上限の中で、到達できる状態や候補をすべて調べ終えたこと。その範囲の外については何も示さない。",
          "en": "Every reachable state or candidate within the declared scope and bounds was examined. It says nothing outside that range."
        },
